      "claim": "The trip record establishes the two distances the POL-RD-01 threshold test runs on: the platform's booked optimal route was 14.0 km and the trip as driven was 18.2 km, an excess of 4.2 km. That excess is 30.0% of the optimal distance, so it clears the 20% limb of POL-RD-01, and it is 4.2 km in absolute terms, so it clears the 0.8 km limb as well. Both establishment tests pass and the deviation is ESTABLISHED.",
