      "claim": "The trace impairment does not defeat the claim. POL-RD-07(a) to (c) is met by the single 100.0 s gap, so the trace is impaired for policy purposes and the deviation cannot rest on the trace alone. It does not rest on the trace alone: the trip record independently records the booked optimal distance of 14.0 km and the driven distance of 18.2 km, and the fare breakdown independently records the distance charged and the metered fare model. The excess is corroborated by artifacts outside the trace, so POL-RD-10(3) is not engaged and the case does not escalate.",
