    {
      "claim": "The rider has discharged the POL-RD-08 burden. The trip record, the trace and the fare breakdown all carry the same trip identifier TRP-02826 and the same pickup and start timestamps, so the artifacts describe the same trip; and the excess of 4.2 km meets the POL-RD-01 threshold. The burden has shifted to the driver, who has pointed to no artifact and no clause that exonerates the excess.",
